+Reference solution. analysis/analyze.py loads the export into a FoaMES EventLog (which sorts it), and takes variants, case durations, rework and waiting-time bottlenecks from foames.foames_process_mining.discovery. Three work orders never reached Pack; their cycle times are only lower bounds, and they are included in the median as the request asks. The export cannot say why Inspect queues: QC staffing and batching are the first things to check with people.
